<description>&lt;p&gt;Landmines continue to explode in Idlib countryside, killing children and injuring others, while a mine-clearing operation in Deir ez-Zor killed a Syrian soldier and wounded two. Lebanese army forces seized 264 kilograms of explosives near the border and Syrian anti-narcotics officials destroyed a large captagon shipment, showing ongoing cross-border illicit trade. Russian air strikes hit Aleppo, killing three children, and the United Nations recognized Syria’s anti-drug and anti-crime efforts. The interim Syrian government is attempting to integrate thousands of foreign fighters into its security forces, a development not noted in the previous briefing. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNOS05SWlSZnZpZlZvUUZfUTkwYS1OaDlubmZncFFZWHVPWE5RNnY3UFN2VHdwcmdyWDViMHVMRllZSmtCMHNjLTV5U1FodzB0T2EyNURjS0hiay1uYWwxQ3IyUlR2SHpSeUh4REVKeG9WWWd2WUFjczlJWnE4RHZyb0dFalRQNUJ1T1JkWlpUNngxWVVjem96aXBRNWNQcG5aLVRRRjBsTHZSdUdOR1FHQ19EbjBTVmFGRWZMMm1Ocw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPWmZHSWVrUExRZi1fWlRQNzdvVWFLcFVXWEotRU5HTk0tazByanA2cXItcFVXdU9VbUI0OUotUnluckxFMzlEWHd4cnUxaG1CWVVaRVNQYzlLSkxJemZxTnRlNE84b2ltSW9XSmNuZXhWZWNtYUsxd0taVnJxQnJDMGFvbDM3dmZTX2F0dnh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Syrian Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxPcFJGRERYVlVHU2pleHR3NGVRakFSZkpSMGRkaEotYmMtWG9KTXAxR0xaVFJBUkVra055X196VUQxRFFDZk42RmNLclNfbEF5UUY5clpsT1ZqX1EwOWM2engwUjBtSm8xb0c2Z1E2TzFiZG9GeUthcnBJQWNweE5NTTRDUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https:/